  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large heavy pot over medium-high heat for 1 minute.",
    "Add the onion and bell pepper. Cook for 5 minutes, stirring often, until soft.",
    "Stir in the garlic and cook for 30 seconds.",
    "Add the ground beef. Cook for 8 minutes, breaking it up with a spoon, until no pink remains and it reaches 160 F.",
    "Stir in the chili powder, cumin, smoked paprika, oregano, salt, and pepper. Cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the crushed tomatoes, kidney beans, and water. Scrape up any browned bits from the bottom of the pot.",
    "Bring to a boil, then reduce the heat to low. Simmer uncovered for 25 minutes, stirring now and then, until thick.",
    "Taste and add more salt if needed. Cool leftovers fully before storing in airtight containers in the fridge or freezer."
  ],
